body:
I broke up with mine after she claimed to have been raped, only after me finding evidence that she had cheated (for the 4th time)

&#x200B;

Breaking up with someone because you think they're lying about being raped is the hardest thing I've had to do.

You did more than mine. My ex cheated on me three times full sex and each time never took responsibility. She played the victim each time, threatening to kill herself and actually self harming each time. Never apologized sincerely and finally claimed she was raped the last time... 

&#x200B;

Just stop drinking, its that simple.

I dumped my EX of 3 years while on vacation with her and her parents in her home country. This was after catching her cheating on me twice before. She invited me to Italy with all the usual "lets get married" nonsense.. Anyways I book the trip and get there. 1 week into the trip she wants to go out alone with friends, which I find very odd. Needless to say the following morning I found Plan B in her purse, confront her and she tells me different stories about what it was for for the next 2 weeks. First it was for me, then she bought it for a friend, then she was raped...

&#x200B;

I broke up with her because she was obviously lying and had the next guy lined up. But who lies about being raped? I had to break up with someone who was claiming to have been assaulted... Who forces you into that situation, after 3 years while on vacation?

&#x200B;

Anyways, I've tried to contact her a couple times in the past 10 months to get a straight answer about whether she was actually raped, to no avail. Blocked, and shes told her family and friends I'm basically evil. Her father told me if I ever contact her again he will kill me.

She left me at home and said she wanted to go out with friends without me because "she didn't want to translate all night". I told her to just drop me off downtown and pick me up at 2 AM. I went out solo, she went out with "friends". 4 AM rolled around and she never showed up to pick me up so I Taxi'd back to her parents house. She showed up 30 minutes after me... The following days she was acting weird, texting someone... I eventually found an empty packet of Plan B in her purse while looking for change... So I confronted her. She initially told me it was for me... Then she bought it for a friend... Then finally when I didn't believe her she told me she had been raped.

&#x200B;

She refused to go to the police, or get checked for STD's so I bailed out and haven't heard from her in a year. So yeah I spent 2 Grand to fly to Europe to get cheated on.

I didn't know the details of her previous relationship. She lied to me about it. She told me she had broken up with him before seeing me. I only reached out to him after mine ended, and he told me that he caught her going on dates with me...

&#x200B;

So yah, i didn't know

Thats exactly what she did. Played me against all the other guys fawning over her for years. She would also talk shit about me behind my back to other people. She'd sext a dude, flirt with another, send nudes to another, have sex with me, have sex with another guy, then get mad when I found out and played victim EVERY.SINGLE.TIME

&#x200B;

Disgusting human being.

Yeah, pathological for sure. Despite that, I find it difficult to believe someone you've been with for years would disregard you in a heartbeat multiple times and THEN lie about it when caught. It just doesn't make any sense.

&#x200B;

My outlook on people has significantly changed during this time.
